// nyunisphere: the Unisphere (1964 World's Fair): 120 ft (37 m) stainless-steel globe, 140 ft (43 m) high, tilted 23.5 deg,
// a grid of meridians and parallels with the continents as textured plates, three orbit rings, on an inverted tripod in
